- op: discuss  # 42e7
  at: '2026-03-04T04:43:16Z'  # 42e7
  by: agent  # 42e7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 42e7
  clock: 8  # 42e7
  nonce: '42e7'  # 42e7
  message: "You're right — the discussion focused on DEEP mode only. BROAD mode (scripts/bakeoff): Currently supports 'run' (current cohort), has no --all/--some flags for running multiple cohorts in batch. The BROAD workflow is typically single-cohort (run → diagnose → cycle). For consistency, BROAD should also support: (1) 'run --all' to process all unanalyzed cohorts, (2) 'run --some N' for batched processing, (3) 'diagnose --all/--some' for multi-cohort diagnostics. The BROAD 'status' command already shows per-cohort breakdown. Implementation would mirror DEEP's batch-processing loop."  # 42e7
